58#issuecomment-2810243405","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105458","id":2810243405,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ngOlN","user":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-16T17:28:39Z","updated_at":"2025-04-16T17:28:39Z","body":"Yes, I tried that in #97707 and it caused big complications for safe games.\nChanging the other one, will cause compatibility breakages for existing games.\n\nSo both options are currently a no-go and we are currently stuck in this non ideal situation until we can break compatibility or we have sufficient reasons for breaking compatibility.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810243405/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2843883506","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105458#issuecomment-2843883506","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105458","id":2843883506,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pgjfy","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T01:36:36Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T01:38:22Z","body":"I noticed that in the InputMap, the InputEvent recorded in the Action is only used for comparison. The events actually used and the events recorded in the InputMap are not completely mixed together.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a3d205f1ad22e779a64921fb56d62b893881ae/core/input/input_map.cpp#L162-L164\n\nSo additional conversion logic can be added to the setter/getter to ensure that the used value is remapped to other values ​​while the record saved in the file remains unchanged.\n\nALL_DEVICES:  save as -1 <=> use as -10\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2843883506/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4002194951","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105458#issuecomment-4002194951","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105458","id":4002194951,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ujKYH","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-05T04:56:40Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T04:58:57Z","body":"Maybe we can change the `ALL_DEVICES` constant to `-3` and then fix the `device` property of `InputEvent`s in `InputMap::action_add_event()` like in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116526 ? That way we don't have to add new logic to the project converter.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4002194951/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4003032702","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105458#issuecomment-4003032702","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105458","id":4003032702,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7umW5-","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-05T07:51:14Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T07:54:09Z","body":"Perhaps we could consider using a mask.\n\n```cpp\nuint32_t device = 0;\n\nenum DeviceMask {\n\tDEVICE_ID_MASK = 0xFFFF,\n\tDEVICE_EMULATION = 1 << 16,\n\tDEVICE_INTERNAL = 1 << 17,\n\tDEVICE_JOYPAD = 1 << 18,\n\tDEVICE_KEYBOARD = 1 << 19,\n\tDEVICE_MOUSE = 1 << 20,\n\tDEVICE_TYPE_MASK = DEVICE_EMULATION | DEVICE_INTERNAL | DEVICE_JOYPAD | DEVICE_KEYBOARD | DEVICE_MOUSE,\n};\n```\nThis also makes it easier to define **all** for each category.\n\n`DEVICE_ID_MASK & device == 0 (or DEVICE_ID_MASK)`\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4003032702/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4003063153","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105458#issuecomment-4003063153","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105458","id":4003063153,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7umeVx","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-05T07:56:03Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T07:56:03Z","body":"> Perhaps we could consider using a mask.\n> \n> uint32_t device = 0;\n> \n> enum DeviceMask {\n> \tDEVICE_ID_MASK = 0xFFFF,\n> \tDEVICE_EMULATION = 1 << 16,\n> \tDEVICE_INTERNAL = 1 << 17,\n> \tDEVICE_JOYPAD = 1 << 18,\n> \tDEVICE_KEYBOARD = 1 << 19,\n> \tDEVICE_MOUSE = 1 << 20,\n> \tDEVICE_TYPE_MASK = DEVICE_EMULATION | DEVICE_INTERNAL | DEVICE_JOYPAD | DEVICE_KEYBOARD | DEVICE_MOUSE,\n> };\n> This also makes it easier to define **all** for each category.\n> \n> `DEVICE_ID_MASK & device == 0 (or DEVICE_ID_MASK)`\n\nNot sure, since we already have constants for emulation and internal devices, [as well as keyboards and mice](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116274) 😅  ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https:/